&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn.victor42.work/posts/2012-10/10-06/45.jpg"
loading="lazy"
alt="沿海峭壁在阳光暴晒下折射出的暗红色岩斑图"
